WEBVTT

00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:15,570
I saw your post on turkey tail mushrooms. Do you have that available to add to our protocol?

00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:22,450
It is one of the six mushrooms in rice coffee, so rice coffee is a brand of coffee that is a

00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:28,770
mushroom coffee. Would you recommend using that to get the turkey tail? So rice coffee has

00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:35,570
very like six different mushrooms in the coffee and you're putting a tablespoon in your coffee

00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:40,690
as a instant coffee and it is organic, so you could certainly use that.

00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:48,850
But remember, if I did your cheek swab and it didn't say you needed to use turkey tail mushrooms,

00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:54,930
then you don't need it. But if you feel like you want to add turkey tail mushrooms to your protocol,

00:00:55,730 --> 00:01:02,610
you could use rice coffee. We have our turkey tail complete product, our cutters clinic,

00:01:02,610 --> 00:01:08,770
turkey tail product also. Also another good brand is the host defense turkey tail.

00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:13,810
Product, those are the two good products that we have in the store that I like the best.

00:01:14,850 --> 00:01:18,210
But you could use rice coffee if you like that. That's fine too.

00:01:20,130 --> 00:01:25,650
There really isn't a downside to adding mushrooms to anybody's protocol. So

00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:35,490
the only caveat to that would be if you have brain cancer, you don't want to add lions made.

00:01:35,490 --> 00:01:44,690
But short of having brain cancer, there really isn't any negatives to adding any of the mushrooms

00:01:44,690 --> 00:01:55,570
to your protocol, any of the mushrooms. So yeah, that would be just fine.

